{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": { "columns": 12, "gap": 16 },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "APIs & externe Schnittstellen", "variant": "hero" },
        "data": { "dataset": "summary" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "KPIStrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                { "label": "Open URL",          "field": "open_url_steps",       "format": "number" },
                { "label": "Insert from URL",   "field": "insert_url_steps",     "format": "number" },
                { "label": "MBS cURL-Chunks",   "field": "mbs_curl_chunks",      "format": "number" },
                { "label": "Eindeutige URLs",   "field": "distinct_urls",        "format": "number" },
                { "label": "Externe Quellen",   "field": "external_sources",    "format": "number" },
                { "label": "Import Records",    "field": "import_records_steps", "format": "number" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 6, "title": "API-Familien" },
        "data": { "dataset": "api_families" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "api_family",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "columns": [
                { "field": "api_family", "label": "Familie" },
                { "field": "hits",       "label": "Hits",   "align": "right" },
                { "field": "hosts",      "label": "Hosts",  "align": "right" },
                { "field": "urls",       "label": "URLs",   "align": "right" },
                { "field": "files",      "label": "Dateien","align": "right" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openDashboard",
                              "args": { "id": "external_apis",
                                        "params": { "api_family": "{{api_family}}" } } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 6, "title": "Externe Datenquellen (FileMaker Multi-File)" },
        "data": { "dataset": "external_sources" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "name",
              "density": "compact",
              "columns": [
                { "field": "name",          "label": "Ziel" },
                { "field": "type",          "label": "Typ",     "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "used_in_files", "label": "Dateien", "align": "right" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": { "span": 12, "title": "URL-Detailliste" },
        "data": { "dataset": "url_details" },
        "children": [
          { "type": "Table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "url",
              "density": "compact",
              "columns": [
                { "field": "api_family",  "label": "Familie",      "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "host",        "label": "Host" },
                { "field": "source_type", "label": "Quelle",       "format": "badge" },
                { "field": "name",        "label": "Script/Kontext" },
                { "field": "file",        "label": "Datei" },
                { "field": "context",     "label": "Step/Typ" },
                { "field": "url",         "label": "URL" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": { "action": "openObject",
                              "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "type": "Script", "file": "{{file}}" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Hinweise\n\n- **Klassifizierung**: URLs werden anhand des Hostnamens automatisch einer API-Familie zugeordnet. Unklassifizierte landen in *Andere*.\n- **Quellen**: Berücksichtigt werden `Open URL`/`Insert from URL`-Schritte sowie alle in Calculations enthaltenen `http(s)://`-Literale (Custom Functions, Calculated Fields, AutoEnter-Berechnungen).\n- **MBS cURL**: Die Zahl der cURL-Chunks zählt jede Verwendung von `CURL.*`-Funktionen in Formel-Bestandteilen — eine Anfrage erzeugt typischerweise mehrere Chunks (SetOption, Perform, GetResult).\n- **Externe Quellen**: Aktuell sind nur FileMaker-Verweise (Multi-File-Lösung) registriert; ODBC/JDBC-Quellen würden hier ebenfalls erscheinen.\n- **Filter**: Ein Klick auf eine API-Familie filtert die Detail-Liste auf diese Gruppe."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
